Message-ID: <asaY-AjO-ko.gAVoksoVCQAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <asaY-AjO-ko.h4v8ZRpPAwAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <asaY-AjO-ko.h4v8ZRpPAwAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/asaY-AjO-ko/m/gAVoksoVCQAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

p1 + scale_y_continuous(labels = scales::scientific, limits=c(100, NA), oob = scales::rescale_none)

From: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/10365167/geom-bar-bars-not-displaying-when-specifying-ylim

I'm not sure why this works, but it seems to fix it.

Brandon

